  "subtitles": [
    {
      "start": 0.15,
      "end": 2.85,
      "text": "What if your work got done… while you slept?"
    },
    {
      "start": 2.95,
      "end": 5.85,
      "text": "That's the promise of AI agents."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.1,
      "end": 8.9,
      "text": "Emails. Meetings. Reports. Follow-ups."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.0,
      "end": 11.7,
      "text": "Every week, the to-do list multiplies."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.35,
      "end": 15.4,
      "text": "An AI agent doesn't just answer questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.5,
      "end": 18.75,
      "text": "It plans, acts and follows through — on its own."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.3,
      "end": 22.0,
      "text": "Before AI, every task landed on one desk."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.1,
      "end": 24.8,
      "text": "Yours. Hours of copying, filing and chasing."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.15,
      "end": 28.2,
      "text": "But here's the catch: AI agents make mistakes."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.3,
      "end": 31.2,
      "text": "Wrong numbers, confident tone. Always check the work."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.85,
      "end": 34.6,
      "text": "So… will AI take your job?"
    },
    {
      "start": 34.7,
      "end": 37.75,
      "text": "It will take tasks. That's not the same thing."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.3,
      "end": 41.4,
      "text": "AI can draft. But judgment, taste and creativity"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.5,
      "end": 44.75,
      "text": "still come from people. From you."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.3,
      "end": 48.4,
      "text": "The people who thrive will learn the tools,"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.5,
      "end": 51.5,
      "text": "adapt fast, and create more than ever."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.4,
      "end": 56.4,
      "text": "Would you trust AI with your job?"
    },
    {
      "start": 56.5,
      "end": 59.8,
      "text": "Yes or no — tell me in the comments."
    }
  ]
